WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.929
QuotePlate connects your kitchen, purchasing decisions
and suppliers.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.286
Add your restaurant and delivery address.

00:00:07.506 --> 00:00:09.837
Keep purchasing together in one workspace.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.642
Add the owner’s details, then open Today.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:28.085
Type or paste dishes, use your phone, upload photos,
or use a permitted website.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.874
Review the ingredients, quantities and units.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.256
Then approve the menu for purchasing.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:47.419
Paste your supplier contacts. Review the list, then
add them to your restaurant.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:53.355
Create a purchase from your approved menu.

00:00:53.575 --> 00:00:55.636
Check quantities, dates and suppliers.

00:00:55.856 --> 00:00:58.075
Save the draft, then open it for quotes.

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:09.315
Share a private link on WhatsApp, by email, or copy
it.

00:01:09.535 --> 00:01:10.688
You send the message.

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:18.299
Suppliers can quote on their phone. Choose a clear
price-list photo, or paste prices.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.662
Check the matched item and rate, then fill the quote.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:28.516
Use one item at a time if helpful. Review delivery and
the total, then send.

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:34.492
Compare coverage, prices and delivery.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:38.591
Here, offers total four hundred and four hundred forty
rupees.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.669
Choose the suitable supplier and confirm.

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:48.320
Ordered ten kilos, received nine.

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:50.847
Check quantities and the invoice.

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:57.940
Record the missing kilo and forty rupees still owed,
then save.

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:02.407
Today keeps delivery follow-ups in view.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:06.065
Share a private supplier workspace.

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:13.391
Suppliers confirm contacts, categories and delivery
terms, then review their own orders.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:19.973
Search public listings for nearby supplier leads.

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:25.311
Plan portions, check stock, and see missing
ingredients.

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:30.997
Review supplier price ranges, spending and delivery
performance.

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:35.421
Keep purchase history, and repeat orders as new
drafts.

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:38.619
Keep every purchase clear.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:43.712
Start your first purchase with QuotePlate. Every
quote, accountable.
